  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 207.34 Standard for Granting Motion for Rehearing. A motion for rehearing in a case subject to appeal under RSA 282-A shall be granted if it meets the requirements of RSA 282-A:60 or 67, as applicable.\n\nSource. #7246, eff 4-30-00; ss by #9126, INTERIM, eff 4-20-08, EXPIRES: 10-17-08; ss by #9296, eff 10-17-08",
